---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service - Get Yo Frozen Yogurt"
  description="Terms of Service for Get Yo mobile application and website"
>
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-50 via-white to-pink-50 py-12">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4">
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-xl md:p-8">
        <div class="mb-8">
          <a
            href="/"
            class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center text-primary transition-colors hover:text-orange-600"
          >
            <i class="ri-arrow-left-line mr-2"></i>
            Back to Home
          </a>
          <div class="text-center">
            <h1 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 md:text-4xl">
              Terms of Service
            </h1>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">Last Updated: January 15, 2025</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="prose max-w-none space-y-8">
          <section>
            <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
              Welcome to Get Yo
            </h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              These Terms of Service cover your use of the Get Yo Frozen Yogurt
              mobile app, our websites (frozenyogurtcafe.com), and related
              services. By using any of these, you're agreeing to these terms.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              If you don't agree with these terms, please don't use our
              services.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
              Age Requirements
            </h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              You need to be at least 13 years old to use Get Yo. If you're
              between 13 and 17, please get your parent's or guardian's
              permission first.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
              Related Policies
            </h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              These Terms work together with our <a
                href="/privacy-policy"
                class="font-semibold text-primary underline hover:text-orange-600"
                >Privacy Policy</a
              >. Both are important, so please read them both.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
              Changes to These Terms
            </h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              We might update these Terms from time to time. When we make
              significant changes, we'll post the new version and notify
              registered users if needed. Continuing to use the app after
              changes means you accept the updated Terms.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
              How to Use Our Services
            </h2>

            <h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800">
              Things You Shouldn't Do
            </h3>
            <p class="mb-3 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">Please don't:</p>
            <ul class="mb-4 ml-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-2 text-gray-700">
              <li>Break any laws or regulations</li>
              <li>Send spam or harass other users</li>
              <li>Try to reverse engineer or hack the app</li>
              <li>Use bots or automated scripts</li>
              <li>Mess with the app's security or functionality</li>
              <li>Pretend to be someone else</li>
              <li>Upload viruses or malicious code</li>
              <li>Try to access other users' accounts</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800">
              Things We'd Appreciate
            </h3>
            <ul class="ml-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-2 text-gray-700">
              <li>Be honest with the information you provide</li>
              <li>Respect other users' privacy</li>
              <li>Use the app for its intended purpose</li>
              <li>Keep your account credentials secure</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Your Account</h2>
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              To use certain features, you'll need to create an account. When
              you do:
            </p>
            <ul class="ml-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-2 text-gray-700">
              <li>Provide accurate information</li>
              <li>Keep your password safe</li>
              <li>
                Let us know immediately if someone accesses your account without
                permission
              </li>
              <li>
                Remember that you're responsible for what happens with your
                account
              </li>
              <li>Don't share your account with others</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
              Rewards Program (Totally Optional)
            </h2>
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              Our Ounce&Bounce rewards program is run through RewardUp.io. It's
              completely optional - you can use all the main features of the app
              without joining. If you do choose to participate:
            </p>
            <ul class="ml-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-2 text-gray-700">
              <li>You can join or leave anytime</li>
              <li>Open to ages 13+ (with parental consent if under 18)</li>
              <li>Keep your account info accurate</li>
              <li>
                Points are earned based on program rules (which can change)
              </li>
              <li>Points might expire</li>
              <li>We can suspend accounts that abuse the program</li>
              <li>Points have no cash value and can't be transferred</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              Check out <a
                href="https://get-yo.member.rewardup.io"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="text-primary underline hover:text-orange-600"
                >the rewards program</a
              > for full details.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
              Content You Post
            </h2>
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              When you post reviews, flavor suggestions, or other content:
            </p>
            <ul class="ml-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-2 text-gray-700">
              <li>You own your content</li>
              <li>Make sure it doesn't violate anyone's rights</li>
              <li>You give us permission to use it for running the app</li>
              <li>
                We might remove content that breaks these Terms or is
                inappropriate
              </li>
              <li>Please don't post offensive or harmful content</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              We're not responsible for user content and don't necessarily agree
              with opinions posted by users.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
              Account Termination
            </h2>
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              We can suspend or close accounts that violate these Terms or for
              other serious reasons. If that happens:
            </p>
            <ul class="ml-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-2 text-gray-700">
              <li>Your access to the app stops</li>
              <li>We might delete your account data</li>
              <li>You might lose any rewards points (if enrolled)</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              You can also delete your account anytime through app settings. See
              our <a
                href="/account-deletion"
                class="font-semibold text-primary underline hover:text-orange-600"
                >Account Deletion page</a
              >
              for instructions.
            </p>
            <div
              class="mt-4 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-purple-500 bg-purple-50 p-4"
            >
              <p class="text-sm text-purple-900">
                <i class="ri-information-line mr-1 font-bold"></i>
                <strong>Rewards Note:</strong> If you joined Ounce&Bounce rewards
                (managed by RewardUp.io), you need to separately delete that account
                at <a
                  href="https://get-yo.member.rewardup.io"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="font-semibold underline">get-yo.member.rewardup.io</a
                >. Deleting your Get Yo app account doesn't automatically delete
                your rewards account.
              </p>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
              Our Intellectual Property
            </h2>
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              Everything in the app and on our websites - the design, logos,
              text, graphics, software, etc. - belongs to Get Yo or our
              partners. This includes:
            </p>
            <ul class="ml-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-2 text-gray-700">
              <li>App design and interface</li>
              <li>Our logos and branding</li>
              <li>Website content</li>
              <li>All images and graphics</li>
              <li>How the app works behind the scenes</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              Please don't copy, reproduce, or modify any of this without our
              permission.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Disclaimers</h2>

            <h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800">
              How the App Works
            </h3>
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              The app is provided "as is." We do our best, but we can't promise:
            </p>
            <ul class="ml-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-2 text-gray-700">
              <li>That it'll always work perfectly</li>
              <li>That all information is 100% accurate</li>
              <li>That it'll be available 24/7 without interruptions</li>
              <li>That specific flavors will always be in stock</li>
            </ul>

            <h3 class="mb-3 mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800">
              Liability Limits
            </h3>
            <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              To the extent allowed by law, Get Yo isn't liable for indirect
              damages, lost profits, or other consequential damages from using
              the app. If we are liable for something, it won't exceed what you
              paid us in the last 12 months (which is probably nothing, since
              the app is free).
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
              Indemnification
            </h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              If your use of the app causes legal trouble for us (like if you
              violate someone's rights), you agree to cover our legal costs and
              any damages.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
              Third-Party Services
            </h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              Our app connects to some third-party services:
            </p>
            <ul class="ml-4 mt-2 list-inside list-disc space-y-2 text-gray-700">
              <li>RewardUp.io (rewards program)</li>
              <li>Google and Apple (sign-in)</li>
              <li>Social media platforms</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              We're not responsible for how these services work or their privacy
              practices. Use them at your own discretion and check their terms.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
              Push Notifications
            </h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              If you enable push notifications, you'll get alerts about new
              flavors, promotions, and updates. You can turn these off anytime
              in your device settings or app preferences. Standard carrier
              messaging rates might apply.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Privacy</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              How we handle your data is covered in our <a
                href="/privacy-policy"
                class="font-semibold text-primary underline hover:text-orange-600"
                >Privacy Policy</a
              >. By using the app, you agree to that policy too.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Governing Law</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              These Terms are governed by New Jersey law. Any disputes would be
              resolved in the courts of Monmouth County, New Jersey.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Severability</h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              If any part of these Terms is found to be unenforceable, the rest
              still applies. We'll modify the unenforceable part to make it work
              while keeping the original intent.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
              The Whole Agreement
            </h2>
            <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              These Terms, together with our Privacy Policy, make up the
              complete agreement between you and Get Yo regarding the app.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Contact Us</h2>
            <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              Questions about these Terms? Reach out:
            </p>
            <div
              class="rounded-r-lg border-l-4 border-primary bg-orange-50 p-6"
            >
              <p class="mb-3 text-lg font-bold text-gray-800">
                Get Yo Frozen Yogurt
              </p>

              <div class="space-y-3">
                <div>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-gray-700">General Questions:</p>
                  <a
                    href="mailto:support@getyocafe.com"
                    class="text-primary underline hover:text-orange-600"
                  >
                    support@getyocafe.com
                  </a>
                </div>
                <div class="border-t border-orange-200 pt-3">
                  <p class="mb-2 font-semibold text-gray-800">Visit Us:</p>

                  <div class="space-y-2">
                    <div>
                      <p class="font-medium text-gray-700">
                        Marlboro (Kosher Certified)
                      </p>
                      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
                        450 Union Hill Road, Morganville, NJ 07751
                      </p>
                      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Phone: (732) 617-6332</p>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                      <p class="font-medium text-gray-700">New Providence</p>
                      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
                        12 South Street, New Providence, NJ 07974
                      </p>
                      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Phone: (908) 219-4338</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="mt-8 border-t pt-6">
            <p class="text-center text-sm text-gray-500">
              These Terms of Service are effective as of January 15, 2025
            </p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
